  "notes": "{戦|たたか}い means battle, fight, or struggle - the noun form of ⟦{戦|たたか}う→戦う：02071_tatakau⟧ (to fight).\n\nFUNCTIONS:\n- Military: {戦|たたか}い⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧⟦{勝|か}つ→勝つ：01199_katsu⟧ (to win a battle)\n- Sports: ⟦{優勝|ゆうしょう}→優勝：03647_yuushou⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧⟦かけた→かける：00854_kakeru⟧{戦|たたか}い (a fight for the championship)\n- Figurative: ⟦{病気|びょうき}→病気：00771_byouki⟧⟦と→と：00512_to⟧⟦の→の：09472_no⟧{戦|たたか}い (fight against illness)\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- 〜⟦と→と：00512_to⟧⟦の→の：09472_no⟧{戦|たたか}い: fight/battle against ~\n- {戦|たたか}い⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧⟦{勝|か}つ→勝つ：01199_katsu⟧: to win a fight\n- {戦|たたか}い⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧⟦{負|ま}ける→負ける：01134_makeru⟧: to lose a fight\n- {戦|たたか}い⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧⟦{始|はじ}まる→始まる：00841_hajimaru⟧: the battle begins\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- ⟦{戦|たたか}う→戦う：02071_tatakau⟧: to fight (verb)\n- ⟦{戦争|せんそう}→戦争：01450_sensou⟧: war\n- ⟦{闘|たたか}い→闘い：17305_tatakai⟧: fight (alternative kanji, same meaning)\n- ⟦{勝負|しょうぶ}→勝負：01437_shoubu⟧: match, contest",
